    {
      "text": "Among Longevity Heaven’s Four Desolation Immortals, East Desolation Immortal holds the highest status. After West Desolation Immortal Bing Sai Chuan awakens, Fang Yuan notes that even that rank eight legend is only second place, and asks who in the world the East Desolation Immortal is.",
